{% lede %}
Around the end of my first year in grad school I was between research projects and used the time to explore what our lab's laser cutter could do. Instead of cutting flat shapes from sheets, I wanted to see if it could make three-dimensional objects.
{% /lede %}

It turned out to have nothing to do with my research, but making tiny plastic chess pieces was instructive and extremely fun.
